{
  "$comment": [
    "SAMPLE VOCABULARY FOR TESTING — NOT authoritative Nawat. Do not cite.",
    "",
    "Loaded only by `npm run db:seed:dev`, never by `db:seed`, so it cannot",
    "reach production through the reference-data seed. This is a disposable",
    "fixture: real headwords combined with FABRICATED data points — regional",
    "dialect variants, phonetics, example sentences, part-of-speech tags and",
    "placeholder audio URLs — generated to exercise every dimension of the",
    "dictionary UI: browse, search, the type and part-of-speech facets, dialect",
    "precedence ordering, the no-`common`-form primary-translation fallback,",
    "examples, and the audio-available path. The fabricated parts are only",
    "plausible, not verified, so nothing here should be treated as a source.",
    "",
    "It lives in local dev and the throwaway staging/beta environment and is",
    "wiped before the app goes truly live. Real vocabulary is entered later",
    "through the API, per row, with validation, audit logging and attribution",
    "to a real contributor.",
    "",
    "Shape is validated at load against CreateEntrySchema and",
    "CreateTranslationSchema from @nahuat/shared, so this file cannot drift",
    "from the API contract without failing loudly."
  ],
